# Apple Silicon with 16 GB unified memory (MacBook Air/Pro, Mac mini 16 GB). An 18 GB M3 Pro also lands here.
# Metal gives the GPU only ~10.7 GiB here (2/3 of RAM). No uncensored Qwen3.6-35B-A3B build from a verified source is
# small enough: the smallest Native-MTP-Preserved quant (i1-Q2_K) is 12.3 GiB, and the smaller mradermacher heretic
# quants come from a withdrawn upload. So every role runs gpt-oss-20b heretic-ara-v3 (p-e-w ARA, KL 0.055,
# 3/100 refusals) at its native MXFP4 precision:
#   11.28 GiB file. GPU: 11.28 - 0.57 token_embd (stays on CPU) - 8 x 0.395 GiB experts kept on the CPU by
#   --n-cpu-moe 8 = 7.55 GiB + KV 32K 0.75 GiB (12 full-attention layers, 24 KiB/token f16) + ~1.5 compute = ~9.8 GiB.
#   Total RAM for the model ~13.5 GiB, which leaves ~2.5 GiB for macOS and OpenCode: close the browser and heavy apps.
# coder and architect are the same file and args, so they run as one llama-server process (no swaps).
# This is a fallback tier. gpt-oss-20b is a weaker coding agent than Qwen3.6-35B-A3B (the 24 GB+ profiles), 32K is the
# practical minimum context for OpenCode, and memory pressure shows up as swapping. 24 GB is the real floor for this stack.
# `ula logs` prints recommendedMaxWorkingSetSize in MB of 10^6 bytes. At 14000 MB or more (13 GiB), --n-cpu-moe 0 fits
# and is faster. An 18 GB Mac likely reports ~12900 MB (12 GiB): --n-cpu-moe 3 fits there (~11.8 GiB on the GPU).
# Macs with 8 GB (~5.3 GiB for Metal) cannot run this profile.
# embed/rerank are listed but not installed by default: they need ~1.5 GiB more RAM than 16 GB has.
PROFILE_DESC="Apple Silicon, 16 GB unified memory (fallback: gpt-oss-20b heretic, 32K context, tight)"

# alias=catalog_id@ctx[@extra llama-server args]
# Aliases are stable API model names; harness configs only ever reference aliases.
ULA_MODELS="
coder=gpt-oss-20b-heretic-ara-mxfp4@32768@--n-cpu-moe 8
architect=gpt-oss-20b-heretic-ara-mxfp4@32768@--n-cpu-moe 8
coder-stock=gpt-oss-20b-mxfp4@32768@--n-cpu-moe 8
architect-stock=gpt-oss-20b-mxfp4@32768@--n-cpu-moe 8
embed=qwen3-embedding-0.6b-q8@4096@-ngl 0
rerank=qwen3-reranker-0.6b-q8@4096@-ngl 0
"
# Installed by default; the rest with `ula pull --all` or `install.sh --all-models`.
ULA_DEFAULT="coder architect"

ULA_CODER=coder
ULA_ARCHITECT=architect
ULA_SWAP_LLMS=true          # true: one chat model resident at a time
ULA_GPU_ARGS="-ngl 999"
ULA_CHAT_ARGS="--cache-ram 0"      # no host-RAM prompt cache: there is no RAM to spare (the in-slot KV is still reused)
ULA_TTL=600                 # unload an idle chat model after 10 min to give RAM back
ULA_MIN_DISK_GIB=5
